<span id="S2.F1.pic1.13.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.13.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">Show that for some <math id="S2.F1.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>, LHS <math id="S2.F1.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bmod\,k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em">mod</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bmod\,k</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.13.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.13.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">doesn’t equal RHS <math id="S2.F1.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bmod\,k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em">mod</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bmod\,k</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.13.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.13.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">hence equality can’t hold.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.9pt"><path d="M 217.03 -85.88 C 217.03 -75.01 208.21 -66.19 197.34 -66.19 C 186.47 -66.19 177.66 -75.01 177.66 -85.88 C 177.66 -96.75 186.47 -105.56 197.34 -105.56 C 208.21 -105.56 217.03 -96.75 217.03 -85.88 Z M 197.34 -85.88"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.9pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 193.88 -90.34)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.92" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.14" class="ltx_text">6</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6FF;" fill="#E6E6FF" stroke="#000000"><path d="M 153.54 -226.26 L -106.3 -226.26 C -112.41 -226.26 -117.37 -231.21 -117.37 -237.33 L -117.37 -360.75 C -117.37 -366.87 -112.41 -371.82 -106.3 -371.82 L 153.54 -371.82 C 159.66 -371.82 164.61 -366.87 164.61 -360.75 L 164.61 -237.33 C 164.61 -231.21 159.66 -226.26 153.54 -226.26 Z M -117.37 -371.82"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -106.3 -251.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:13.04em;--ltx-fo-height:1em;--ltx-fo-depth:7.92em;font-size:10pt;" height="123.43" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 13.84)" width="180.44"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:13.04em;">
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">Pick <math id="S2.F1.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2</annotation></semantics></math>. RHS is even, so</span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">LHS must be even as well. The</span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">parity of <math id="S2.F1.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> is the same as <math id="S2.F1.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math>. Since</span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.5" class="ltx_p"><math id="S2.F1.pic1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a,b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="1.440em">a</mi><mo mathsize="1.440em">,</mo><mi mathsize="1.440em">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a,b</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;"> are coprime, one of them</span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">must be odd. But maybe both are</span></span>
<span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.15.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">odd, so there’s no contradiction.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.9pt"><path d="M -104.88 -219.06 C -104.88 -208.19 -113.69 -199.38 -124.56 -199.38 C -135.44 -199.38 -144.25 -208.19 -144.25 -219.06 C -144.25 -229.93 -135.44 -238.75 -124.56 -238.75 C -113.69 -238.75 -104.88 -229.93 -104.88 -219.06 Z M -124.56 -219.06"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.9pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -128.02 -223.52)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.92" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S2.F1.pic1.16" class="ltx_text">7</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6FF;" fill="#E6E6FF" stroke="#000000"><path d="M 129.92 -409.78 L -82.68 -409.78 C -88.79 -409.78 -93.75 -414.73 -93.75 -420.85 L -93.75 -485.32 C -93.75 -491.44 -88.79 -496.39 -82.68 -496.39 L 129.92 -496.39 C 136.03 -496.39 140.99 -491.44 140.99 -485.32 L 140.99 -420.85 C 140.99 -414.73 136.03 -409.78 129.92 -409.78 Z M -93.75 -496.39"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -82.68 -458.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:10.67em;--ltx-fo-height:1.08em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.36em;font-size:10pt;" height="19.93" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 14.94)" width="147.64"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
